    "Bxd8"
   ],
   "spoken": "Here's the snare the early knight set: if the centre pawns are swapped and the knight is captured, a bishop grabs the queen — but the in-between check on b4 wins the piece straight back and leaves an extra one in hand. A famous old trap that catches players well into club strength.",
   "kind": "tactic",
